    SIS -.independent protection.-> DG
    SIS -.independent protection.-> NU
    SIS -.independent protection.-> BL
    SIS -.independent protection.-> DO
  end

  HIST[(Historian)]
  L02 -- read-only via one-way gateway --> HIST
  HIST -- read-only --> QA
  HIST -- read-only --> EA
  HIST -- read-only --> MA
  ZT -- signed advisory package --> OP
  MOC -- approved change only --> L02
  MR <--> TR
  RR <--> TR
  CE <--> TR
  TR -- signed model artifact --> ORCH
  CA -- evidence record --> CE
  ZT -. policy from .-> MR

